{"sourceUrl":"https://dce.jlu.edu.cn/info/1032/11004.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:29.378921+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://dce.jlu.edu.cn/info/1032/11004.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>为促进全国信息与通信工程、控制科学与工程学科高校大学生之间的学术交流，向广大学子提供了解吉林大学通信工程学院的机会，我院将于</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>-8</span></span><span><span>日举办</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年校园学术活动开放日。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>一、申请资格</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，道德品质优良，遵纪守法，身心健康，在校期间没有受过纪律处分。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>全国高校本科三年级在校生（</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年毕业），达到所在学校推荐免试生的要求，预期能够获得所在学校的推免生资格，或成绩优异拟报考通信工程学院硕士研究生的学生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>英语水平良好，全国大学英语四级考试成绩在</span></span><span><span>425</span></span><span><span>分以上。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、</span></span><span><span>活动安排</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>活动时间：</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>日</span><span>—</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>活动地点：吉林大学南湖校区第一教学楼</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>活动内容：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）学术讲座</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）综合考核</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）师生见面会</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>）参观考察</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三、申请流程</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>网上报名：申请的同学于</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>23</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>24:00</span></span><span><span>前登录以下网址进行网上报名：</span></span><strong><span><span>https://yzb.jlu.edu.cn/</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>提交电子版申请材料，要求：清晰彩色扫描件或照片的</span></span><span><span>PDF</span></span><span><span>版，打包成一个压缩文件（压缩包和邮件命名格式：姓名</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>申报专业</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>校园学术活动开放日），发送至邮箱：</span></span><span><span>txyjsb@163.com</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电子版申请材料清单：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）《报名表》，由报名系统中填报生成。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）本科成绩单和成绩排名（加盖教务处公章），以</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>个学期成绩计</span></span><span><span>,</span></span><span><span>我院学生不需加盖公章。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）专家推荐信</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>份，</span></span><span><span>由我院具有招生资格的导师出具，具体导师信息请查询学院网站：</span></span><a href=\"https://dce.jlu.edu.cn/yjsjy/xkzy.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://dce.jlu.edu.cn/yjsjy/xkzy.htm</span></span></span></a><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>）其它材料（如：英语四、六级证明，发表论文、专利证明，以及各类获奖或资格证书）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>注意：所有电子版申请材料信息必须与网报信息完全一致，否则将影响报名；电子版申请材料收取截止时间：</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>23</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>16</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>00</span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>提交材料后加入</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://dce.jlu.edu.cn/__local/1/5A/D4/EC02C9B1DFFEBA86AE3F6D5B775_BDCB0F85_117E.png\"/></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年通信工程学院校园学术活动开放日</span></span><span><span>”QQ</span></span><span><span>群：</span></span><span><span>970047925</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>验证信息为</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>申报专业</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>所在学校</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四、资格审核</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院组织专家组根据申请人的学业水平、科研能力等，对申请人进行入围资格审查，入围名单将于</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>日之前公布在吉林大学通信工程学院网站：</span></span><span><span>https://dce.jlu.edu.cn/yjsjy/tzgg.htm</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、综合考核内容</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>采取笔试和面试相结合的形式。包括专业课笔试、综合面试、英语听说能力测试。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>笔试内容：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>信息与通信工程：单片机原理与应用、模拟与数字电子技术</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>控制科学与工程：计算机控制技术，电力拖动自动控制系统</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>通信工程（含宽带网络、移动通信等）：单片机原理与应用、模拟与数字电子技术</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>控制工程：计算机控制技术，电力拖动自动控制系统</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>综合面试内容：主要考核考生的专业知识、综合素质和能力：包括考生的思想政治素质和道德品质、语言表达能力、考生应用所学专业知识分析和解决实际问题的能力，考生本人学习、工作中的业绩情况，考生的人文素养，举止言行、表达能力和礼仪等。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>六、其它事项</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>我院校园学术活动开放日不收取任何费用，入选学生的交通费和住宿费自理，我院提供参加活动期间的用餐。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>具体活动内容及时间安排另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>在本次活动中综合考核合格，并具备所在学校</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年硕士研究生</span><span>“推荐免试资格”的学生，考核成绩可以做为推免阶段的重要参考依据。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>如有未尽事宜，由通信工程学院研究生招生工作领导小组负责解释。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：梁老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span></span><span><span>0431-85095775</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系邮箱：</span></span><a href=\"https://dce.jlu.edu.cn/info/1032/11004.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>txyjsb@163.com</span></span></span></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span> </span><span><span>吉林大学通信工程学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>                                    2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"903847aa9ea21f54a9c31b8cf65c87b8e1145f1e63574839bb4f6482381bcb88","textLength":1434,"sourceSha256":"c34ebb8f5f51a81e00be07c912412f3447a2f424908ebdaf9b3f107b2635fc6d","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"专家推荐信.docx","url":"https://dce.jlu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1409281823&wbfileid=16572913"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-f881b11577f43989f696","title":"2025年吉林大学通信工程学院2025年校园学术活动开放日通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:29.378921+00:00"}
